  lex_strings_err_unterminated.pcpp - break step of lex_strings.pcpp:
  a string with no closing quote (LX0001)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_unterminated.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_strings_err_unterminated.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe lex_strings_err_unterminated;

begin
  println("never closed); // ERROR LX0001@11: Unterminated string or character literal
end.
